: "/blog/design-material-theme-color", "label": null, "open_new_window": false}, "section": "Material Blog", "title": "Designing a Material Theme: Color"}, "document_id": 5709731908550656, "document_label": null, "repo_id": "mio-example"}]}, "document_id": "6234795288559616"}